---
// Repeated section pattern. Lives at the bottom of all pages except /contact/.
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 px-6 border-t border-subtle">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-8">
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-display text-headline max-w-[20ch]">
      Are you ready to take your product to the next level?
    </h2>
    <a
      href="/contact/"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-12 px-6 bg-accent text-headline font-body font-medium text-base rounded-sm hover:bg-accent-hover active:bg-accent-pressed transition duration-fast shrink-0"
    >
      Let's Talk
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
